# Zoho WorkDrive — team deliverables (Option 2 · human-gated)

## Two ship lanes (do not mix)

| Agent | After Phase 3 approval | Destination |
|---|---|---|
| **Mac / local** | Land pack in **git** with `SHIP.md` (`ship_lane: mac`) + captions + tracker · **TrueSync-write** into existing team folders | `04` · `05-Carousels/` · `06-Statics/` · `07-Video-Prompts/` |
| **Cloud** | Land pack in **git** with `SHIP.md` (`ship_lane: cloud`) · **do not** TrueSync-write main folders | Action → **`_API-DRY-RUN/04–07`** only |

**Never:** Call Zoho APIs from agents · put `ZOHO_REFRESH_TOKEN` in Cloud Agent context · have Mac/local treat `_API-DRY-RUN` as the primary ship folder · have cloud agents overwrite the live `05-Carousels/` TrueSync tree.

**Automation (cloud / Action lane):** When Phase-3 packs with **`ship_lane: cloud`** land on **`main`**, Action `siya-workdrive-phase3-live.yml` syncs them into `_API-DRY-RUN/04–07`. Packs with `ship_lane: mac` are **skipped** by the Action.

